{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Conveyor Belt Sushi Simulator&quot; is a cozy first-person simulation where you serve sushi to customers, earn money, and grow your sushi restaurant business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536670/extras/Steampage_RestaurantManagement_English.png?t=1741052993\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536670/extras/Restaurant-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1741052993\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Design your own conveyor belt and serve customers promptly to ensure a smooth dining experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536670/extras/Steampage_MakeSushi_English.png?t=1741052993\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536670/extras/makeSush-optimize.gif?t=1741052993\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make sushi and place it on the conveyor belt, allowing customers to pick their favorite sushi.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536670/extras/Steampage_OrderStock_English.png?t=1741052993\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536670/extras/OrderStock-optimize.gif?t=1741052993\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Order stock from the supplier using your tablet. Seafood prices vary daily based on the day's supply.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536670/extras/Steampage_CalculateBill_English.png?t=1741052993\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536670/extras/scan-optimize.gif?t=1741052993\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scan the sushi plates to calculate the bill. Make sure you don\u2019t miss any plates, or you\u2019ll receive less money!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536670/extras/Steampage_ServingCustomers_English.png?t=1741052993\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536670/extras/handleCustomer-optimize.gif?t=1741052993\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Clean the table for the next customer and deal with troublesome customers before they cause any trouble</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536670/extras/Steampage_ExpandYourRestaurant_English.png?t=1741052993\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536670/extras/Expand-optimize.gif?t=1741052993\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn profits to reinvest in your restaurant. Expand your space, unlock new sushi recipes, and hire staff to help you run the restaurant.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3536670?t=1741052993","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536670/a1df303310a0b8216b0fb9dd0ea220b84bf8824d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741052993","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536670/05616044f2d34f6ad0d8dc7758da7155662b1310/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741052993","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c